      "hizbQuarter": 164,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3491,
      "text": "Whoever submits himself to Allah[8] and does good, has certainly grasped the firmest handhold. To Allah is the ultimate decision of all matters.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 31,
        "name": "سُورَةُ لُقۡمَانَ",
        "englishName": "Luqman",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Luqman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 34,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 413,
      "ruku": 357,
      "hizbQuarter": 165,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3492,
      "text": "But whoever disbelieves, do not let his disbelief grieve you. To Us is their return, then We will inform them of what they used to do. Indeed, Allah is All-Knowing of what is in the hearts.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 31,
        "name": "سُورَةُ لُقۡمَانَ",
        "englishName": "Luqman",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Luqman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 34,
